            <rect x='64' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='64' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='82' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.5 ★ 校正绘图：给坐标轴留边距</text><text x='82' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 解决办法是手动指定范围：ax.axis([0, 1100, 0, 1_</text><text x='82' y='188.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>100_000])，四个数顺序是…</text><text x='82' y='217.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 定制刻度标记。 默认刻度由 matplotlib 自选，大数</text><text x='82' y='236.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>字上会变成 1.0e6 科学计数法，或标签…</text><text x='82' y='265.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· ★ set_xticks 与 set_xticklabels 必须配套调用。</text><text x='82' y='284.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'> 只调后者，标签会被硬贴在…</text><rect x='468' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='468' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='486' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.6 随机游走：RandomWalk 类</text><text x='486' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 随机游走是最简单的随机模型：一只小虫每次随机往一个</text><text x='486' y='188.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>方向走一步，走一千步得到一条弯曲路径。它是布朗运动</text><text x='486' y='208.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>…</text><text x='486' y='236.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· ★ 这里最容易错：为什么要「拒绝原地不动」？ 若允</text><text x='486' y='256.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>许 x 和 y 同时不变，这轮什么也没发生。四种组合…</text><text x='486' y='284.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· ★ random.seed(42) 是这一章最有工程价值的一行。 </text><text x='486' y='304.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>随机性是编程里的「double 难度…</text><rect x='872' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='872' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='890' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.7 Plotly 掷骰子：Die 类</text><text x='890' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· Die 类的设计：骰子是「能被掷的对象」，该有的是—</text><text x='890' y='188.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>—面数（属性）、记住每次结果（属性）、掷一次（方法</text><text x='890' y='208.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>…</text><text x='890' y='236.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· ★ results.count(value) 是本节的关键一招。 想知</text><text x='890' y='256.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>道「1 点出现了多少次」，最笨是…</text><text x='890' y='284.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 画分布图。 px.bar() 需要横纵两组数据；定制用 fig</text><text x='890' y='304.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>.update_layout()（改整体…</text><rect x='64' y='574' width='1152' height='66' rx='12' fill='#EEF5FB' /><text x='84' y='616' fontSize='14' fill='#243444' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>看不懂的地方先回讲义对应小节读一遍，再回来对着这页复述一次——能讲出来才算真懂。</text>
